  "title": "MUFG Appoints Prasad Uddaraju as First Chief Data & Artificial Intelligence Officer",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, NY (June 9, 2026) — Mitsubishi UFJ Financial Group (MUFG), one of the largest global financial groups, today announced the appointment of Prasad Uddaraju as the company’s first Chief Data & Artificial Intelligence Officer. Mr. Uddaraju brings more than two decades of experience modernizing enterprise data platforms, advancing analytics capabilities, and strengthening data governance across leading global financial institutions.",
